            "event_description": "TM8 and Dissident join forces for a nine-hour gathering across two rooms at Fitzroy & Lark. Familiar faces, new guests and residents come together, with a little of each collective's musical personality woven into the night.\r\n\r\nCopenhagen's Mama Snake, co-founder of Amniote Editions, brings her signature mix of hypnotic techno and trance-laced selections to the night. Joining them is a very special guest. More on this one soon.\r\n\r\nFrom Toulouse, Le Comité Des Fêtes co-founder Jan Loup joins with deep, percussive explorations of bass music, dubstep and drum & bass. Dissident residents Carly Zeng and Cryptofauna will be on hand with everything from trippy, off-kilter grooves to raw, rhythmic techno, while TM8 residents olesia and Simrana complete the bill.\r\n\r\nSee you on the dancefloor. (◕◡◕✿)\r\n\r\n✦•┈๑⋅⋯ ⋯⋅๑┈•✦\r\n\r\n** Please note that the purchase of tickets does not guarantee entry.",
